# OpenEdit colour kind: 68000 assembler (Devpac, PhxAss, vasm). MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Dalsin Limited.
name      Assembler
files     #?.(s|asm|i|a68|68k)
case      off
comment   ;
comment0  *
strings   "'
labels    column0
numbers   on
suffix    .
keywords  SECTION CODE DATA BSS CODE_C DATA_C BSS_C CODE_F DATA_F BSS_F XDEF XREF INCLUDE
keywords  INCBIN INCDIR MACRO ENDM EQU EQUR SET REG DC DS DCB EVEN CNOP RS RSRESET RSSET
keywords  IFD IFND IFEQ IFNE IFGT IFLT IFGE IFLE ELSE ENDC END OPT MACHINE FPU ALIGN
commands  abcd add adda addi addq addx and andi asl asr bcc bcs beq bge bgt bhi ble bls blt
commands  bmi bne bpl bvc bvs bra bsr bchg bclr bset btst chk clr cmp cmpa cmpi cmpm cmp2
commands  dbcc dbcs dbeq dbf dbge dbgt dbhi dble dbls dblt dbmi dbne dbpl dbra dbt dbvc dbvs
commands  divs divu divsl divul eor eori exg ext extb illegal jmp jsr lea link lsl lsr move
commands  movea movem movep moveq moveq muls mulu nbcd neg negx nop not or ori pea reset rol
commands  ror roxl roxr rte rtr rts sbcd scc scs seq sf sge sgt shi sle sls slt smi sne spl st
commands  stop sub suba subi subq subx svc svs swap tas trap trapv tst unlk bfchg bfclr bfexts
commands  bfextu bfffo bfins bfset bftst cas cas2 movec moves pack unpk rtd fmove fadd fsub
commands  fmul fdiv fsqrt fabs fneg fcmp ftst fbeq fbne fbgt fblt fbge fble fmovem cinva cpusha
